>[...] the first really really tough creature I hit going
>down the dungeons of doom is that &*&%!!! mumak! The first creature that
>actually toasts me in 2 hits if I'm more than 70 HP!!! What do I have to
>do to kill this thing? In previous games I've just gone out and genocided
